  "summary": "Typosquat with postinstall beacon to Burp Collaborator subdomain",
  "details": "Package name 'exnesss' typosquats 'exness'. The package.json declares scripts.postinstall: 'node./postinstall.js', and postinstall.js issues an HTTPS GET to a hardcoded Burp Collaborator subdomain (hteimcuxkeb6pacscuexz4d9y04rshg6.oastify.com) on every install. This fires automatically on `npm install`, contacting an out-of-band interaction host that reveals the installer's network/DNS metadata to the operator of that Collaborator instance. The package provides no advertised functionality to the installer beyond the beacon.",
